<article class="env-lemma" id="0B3S">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0B3S">Lemma <span data-tag="0B3S">31.16.6</span>.</a> Let $X$ be a locally Noetherian normal scheme. Let $D \subset X$ be an effective Cartier divisor. Then $D$ is $(S_1)$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      By Properties, Lemma <a href="/tag/0345" data-tag="0345">28.12.5</a> we see that $X$ is $(S_2)$. Thus we conclude by Lemma <a href="/tag/0B3R" data-tag="0B3R">31.16.5</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>